# Rust Protocol Proof

Changed protocol/runtime paths:

- `crates/agent-protocol/src/app_game.rs`
- `crates/agent-protocol/src/app_game_tests.rs`
- `crates/agent-core/src/activity_store_app_game.rs`
- `crates/agent-core/src/activity_store_app_game/app_game_journal_sqlite_ingest.rs`
- `crates/agent-core/src/activity_store_app_game/app_game_journal_sqlite_ingest_tests.rs`
- `crates/agent-core/src/activity_store_app_game_observation.rs`

Validation:

```text
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-protocol app_game -- --nocapture
PASS: 10 tests.

cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game_journal_sqlite -- --nocapture
PASS: 3 tests.

cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game -- --nocapture
PASS: 41 tests.
```

Proof summary:

- App/game journal row discriminators are protocol constants.
- Journal events preserve typed row JSON and local-journal custody labels in
  `LogFields`.
- Replay reads the stored SQLite event rows and projects typed inventory,
  running-now, foreground-now, launcher, and daily rollup views.
- Existing sessionization remains the duration source for daily rollups.
